Revision history for JS::Minifier

{{$NEXT}}

    - Fork of JS::Minify by Sam Morrison
    - Rename module from JS::Minify to JS::Minifier
    - Rename .pm6 to .rakumod, .t to .rakutest
    - All-new CLI tool bin/jsminify with --drop-console, --drop-debugger,
      --keep-bang-comments, --nocompress, --strip-debug, --check,
      --copyright, --output
    - Translate documentation and tooling from Perl 6 / perl6 to Raku / raku
    - Add shebang (#!) preservation
    - Add bang-comment (/*! */) preservation
    - Add template literal (backtick string) support with ${} interpolation
    - Add NOCOMPRESS block support (/* BEGIN/END NOCOMPRESS */)
    - Add drop_console option to remove console.* calls
    - Add drop_debugger option to remove debugger; statements
    - Shorten true to !0 and false to !1
    - Remove semicolons before closing braces
    - Strip multi-line string continuations (\\ + newline)
    - Track line and column numbers for better error messages
    - Export js-minify alias for backward compatibility
    - Update META6.json with new maintainer, auth, version 1.0.0, source URL
    - Update .travis.yml for Raku ecosystem
    - Add comprehensive test coverage for all new features
